Z||000009||Oreif||05-17-2001||12:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Steve Normington:<BR><B>AFAIK...<P>The cluster on top of the heater vents is the aux gage cluster which is part of the 120 mph speedo. <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>86/87 SE's had the aux gages but they didn't have the 120mph speedo. That was only available on the GT's and 88 Formula's.<P>Nice looking car! <BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
